SUMMARY:Together Toronto & Ecosystem Showcase
DESCRIPTION:TechTO\n**This is a paid event. You must register and have a t
 icket to attend.** 👉 🎟️ **Tickets are on Luma:** [Pick your ticket
  here](https://luma.com/together-toronto-november-2-2026?utm_source=meetup
 )\n\n**Canada is building companies worth buying from\, backing\, and join
 ing. On November 2\, they open the floor.**\n\nMost people see Canadian in
 novation as a headline. A raise. An exit. A list.\nCo-hosted with the **[S
 chwartz Reisman Innovation Campus ](https://sric.utoronto.ca/?utm_source=m
 eetup)**\n**Ecosystem team**\, more than 35 startups on one floor\, with a
 ccelerators\, founder programs\, and investors that back them. Startups fr
 om U of T\, AI ventures from the Vector Institute\, and from the TechTO co
 mmunity\, all in one room. Come to buy. Come to back. Come to join.\n\n* 
 🤝 **B2B buyers:** find the tools built here before your competitors do\
 n* 💰 **Investors:** meet founders who are raising now\, booth by booth\
 n\nAt 7 pm\, Together Toronto takes the stage with the people who built so
 me of Canada’s biggest company stories.\n\n**🏢 Startup Showcase & Eco
 system Tours**\nEcosystem tours start every 45 minutes from 4:15 PM. See w
 here Toronto’s next startups start:\n\n* **[UTE](https://entrepreneurs.u
 toronto.ca/):** U of T’s entrepreneurship network across all three campu
 ses\n* **[ONRamp](https://entrepreneurs.utoronto.ca/for-entrepreneurs/onra
 mp-membership/):** UTE’s co-working space for founders\n* **[Centre for 
 Entrepreneurship](https://www.entrepreneurship.artsci.utoronto.ca/about-us
 ):** funding and mentorship for students\, faculty and alumni\n* **[UTEST]
 (https://utest.to/):** U of T’s incubator for deep tech and research sta
 rtups\n* **[Black Founders Network](https://entrepreneurs.utoronto.ca/for-
 entrepreneurs/black-founders-network/):** access\, funding and community f
 or Black founders at every stage\n* **[Vector Institute](https://vectorins
 titute.ai/):** one of Canada’s top AI research institutes\n* **[Innovati
 ons & Partnerships Office](https://research.utoronto.ca/ipo):** formalizin
 g partnerships with U of T researchers and technologies\n\n**🎤 Speakers
 **\n\n* **[Sam Pillar](https://www.linkedin.com/in/sampillar/)\, Co-founde
 r & CEO\, [Jobber](https://www.getjobber.com/):** Started Jobber in Edmont
 on in 2011 and grew it past 100\,000 home and commercial service businesse
 s. If you sell software to small businesses\, this is the playbook.\n* **[
 Andrew Lockhead](https://www.linkedin.com/in/andrewlockhead/)\, Co-founder
  & CEO\, [Stay22](https://www.stay22.com/):** Built Stay22 in Montreal int
 o a platform that moved over $1B in travel bookings in 2025\, then raised 
 $122M from Summit Partners. A Canadian company winning the creator economy
 .\n* **[Noah Buchman](https://www.linkedin.com/in/noah-buchman-bbb3079/)\,
  Co-founder\, President & CRO\, [Propel Holdings](https://www.propelholdin
 gs.com/):** Took Propel from a 2011 startup to the TSX\, with lending bran
 ds across Canada\, the US and the UK. A rare inside look at building and l
 isting a Canadian fintech.\n* **[Vanessa Galarneau](https://www.linkedin.c
 om/in/vanessa-galarneau/)\, Co-founder\, [Pluvo](https://pluvo.io/):** Ott
 awa AI startup for finance teams. Raised a $5M seed and was picked for a16
 z speedrun from 19\,000+ applicants. What it takes to build an AI company 
 from Canada right now.\n\n**📝 Agenda**\n\n* **4:00–7:00 PM \\| Startu
 p Showcase & Ecosystem Tours:** 7th Floor Winter Garden\n* **6:30–7:00 P
 M \\| Together Toronto networking**\n* **7:00–8:30 PM \\| Together Toron
 to:** community open mic\, speakers and fireside chats\n* **8:30–9:00 PM
  \\| Networking resumes**\n* **9:00 PM onwards \\| Afterparty \\(offsite\\
 )**\n\n*The Startup Showcase & Ecosystem Tours are free to attend. To stay
  for Together Toronto\, pick the ticket that includes it. Only Together To
 ronto ticket holders get into the 6:30 pm networking and Together program.
 *\n*Co-organized with the [Schwartz Reisman Innovation Campus](https://sri
 c.utoronto.ca/?utm_source=meetup) Ecosystem team\, connecting innovators a
 nd leaders shaping the future of tech.*\n\n**Want in free every month?** [
 Become a TechTO Member](https://www.techto.org/memberships?utm_source=meet
 up) for access to monthly Together events\, quarterly industry events\, an
 d socials.
